Incidentally I played around with my own statistics and found
it informative for me to have the success rate Asc/(Asc+Died)
as well as the absolute delta (Asc-Died) and the normalized
(Asc-Died)/(Asc+Died). For example as in...

   Role    All (A/D)     Success  Delta  Norm

   Arc       5 (0/5)       0.0%    -5   -100%
   Bar       6 (3/3)      50.0%    +0     +0%
   Cav       5 (5/0)     100.0%    +5   +100%
   Hea       5 (1/4)      20.0%    -3    -60%
   Kni       9 (4/5)      44.4%    -1    -11%


